  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 35008bfbbab6945eda6578ac7bad4440, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  label: Ask for Hint
  subLabel: Hint
  activationRadius: 2
  speakerName: Inner Voice
  hint_Start: Something in this room feels unfinished. Start with what was left behind.
  hint_FirstNoteRead: The room is quiet, but not completely silent. Follow the sound.
  hint_TVMessageSeen: The message should lead you toward the library area.
  hint_BookshelfFound: Old stories can lead to old voices. Look for something that
    can play a recording.
  hint_GramophonePlayed: The recording points to something hidden away. Check what
    can be opened.
  hint_SimCardFound: A small missing piece can make a silent device speak again.
  hint_PhoneMessageHeard: After the message, pay attention to time.
  hint_ClockClueSeen: Use the stopped time as the door code.
  hint_KeypadCodeEntered: The keypad should open the way out.
  hint_DoorUnlocked: You have everything you need to leave.
  hint_Complete: The truth is no longer trapped here.
